  - config aggregate ≈96%, policy aggregate ≈90%, hooks aggregate ≈93% — all
    clear the ≥85% targets where applicable; overall clears ≥70%.

### Design decisions (within blueprint/spec, no drift)
- List-union merge preserves lowest-precedence-first order with de-duplication,
